  "description": "Change of use from a sui-generis HMO of 7 bed to a 6 bed supportive living including a rear single storey extension",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - In the absence of a legal agreement, the development fails to secure a nomination agreement agreed with the Council to maximise the utilisation for local residents, and to ensure against the importation of need from outside the Borough, and any necessary monitoring fees and planning services fees. The development would therefore be contrary to adopted Local Plan policies SC1, SC8 and IMP3",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that it would not result in increased parking stress or prejudice highway safety, provides no detail as to visitor and staff car parking or deliveries and servicing arrangements contrary to London Plan policies T5 and T6 and Local Plan policy EC2.",
    "Reason : 3 - The application fails to demonstrate how the proposal would avoid adverse impact on the amenity of neighbouring residents due to the increased comings and goings leading to greater noise and disturbance contrary to Local Plan policies CC2 and EQ5"
  ],
